      "text": "Shift that started well ends poorly. Merilainen tries to clear puck, it hits Chytil and deflects to Gawdin who connects. First NHL goal for Richmond native in 15 games. Lafreniere then goes to backhand deke at top of crease. Two goals in 2:14 and it 4-1. #Canucks #Rangers",
